(Task: Compute -5 in an 8-bit signed integer register.) Tj
T* (Step 1: +5 in binary = 0000 0101) Tj
T* (Step 2: Invert all bits \(One’s Complement\) = 1111 1010) Tj
T* (Step 3: Add 1 to least significant bit = 1111 1011 \(Hexadecimal: 0xFB\).) Tj
T* (Verification: Add \(+5\) + \(-5\) = 0000 0101 + 1111 1011 = [1] 0000 0000 \(Carry discarded, result is 0!\).) Tj
