(• 3rd Generation \(1964-1971\): Integrated Circuits \(ICs\). Jack Kilby and Robert Noyce fabricated multiple transistors on a single silicon chip;) Tj
T* (introduced operating systems, time-sharing, and the IBM System/360 architecture.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
