(Christopher Strachey sought to build a language expressive enough to describe both high-level algorithmic processes \(like) Tj
T* (matrix algebra and symbolic list processing\) and low-level hardware interactions \(such as word-level bit shifting, direct) Tj
T* (address dereferencing, and hardware interrupt dispatch\). This ambition laid the foundation for the next 60 years of computer) Tj
T* (systems engineering.) Tj
