(Trace the technological chain from CPL in 1963 to modern Rust in 2026.) Tj
T* (Model Key Points: \(1\) CPL pioneered the ambition of high-level systems programming; \(2\) BCPL simplified it to word-based) Tj
T* (machine memory; \(3\) B adapted it to minimal minicomputers; \(4\) C added structured hardware byte typing; \(5\) C++ added) Tj
T* (deterministic object lifecycles \(RAII\); \(6\) Rust eliminated temporal memory vulnerabilities \(use-after-free, double-free\) through) Tj
T* (formal compile-time affine type ownership.) Tj
