(• 1. Ahead-Of-Time \(AOT\) Native Compilers: Directly translates entire source code into native machine code \(ELF binaries on Linux, Mach-O on) Tj
T* (macOS, PE on Windows\) prior to execution \(e.g., C, C++, Rust, Go\). Delivers absolute maximum runtime speed with zero startup translation) Tj
T* (latency.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
