39.6850393700787407 446.7403937007873083 Td
(• 3. RAII & Deterministic Destructors \(C++\): Resource Acquisition Is Initialization binds heap memory and OS resources to the lifetime of stack) Tj
T* (objects. When the object exits scope, its destructor automatically frees the resource without runtime GC pauses.) Tj
