(C++ omits mandatory runtime bounds checking to maximize raw execution velocity. Writing beyond an array boundary) Tj
T* (corrupts neighboring stack or heap variables, overwrites saved return addresses \(stack smashing\), or attempts to write into) Tj
T* (read-only memory pages, leading to erratic bugs or exploitable security vulnerabilities \(CVE buffer overflows\).) Tj
