(For T\(n\) = a*T\(n/b\) + f\(n\):) Tj
T* (Case 1: If f\(n\) = O\(n^\(log_b\(a\) - eps\)\), then T\(n\) = Theta\(n^\(log_b\(a\)\)\).) Tj
T* (Case 2: If f\(n\) = Theta\(n^\(log_b\(a\)\) * log^k\(n\)\), then T\(n\) = Theta\(n^\(log_b\(a\)\) *) Tj
T* (log^\(k+1\)\(n\)\).) Tj
T* (Case 3: If f\(n\) = Omega\(n^\(log_b\(a\) + eps\)\) and regularity holds, then T\(n\) = Theta\(f\(n\)\).) Tj
