(Violations:) Tj
T* (1. Single Responsibility \(SRP\): OrderProcessor handles business rules, payment processing, AND database persistence.) Tj
T* (2. Open/Closed \(OCP\): Adding Stripe or Apple Pay requires editing OrderProcessor source code directly.) Tj
T* (3. Dependency Inversion \(DIP\): High-level OrderProcessor directly depends on low-level PayPalClient and MySQL concrete) Tj
T* (classes.) Tj
T* (Refactoring:) Tj
T* (1. Create IPaymentGateway interface with method process\(PaymentRequest req\).) Tj
T* (2. Create IOrderRepository interface with method save\(Order order\).) Tj
T* (3. Implement concrete PayPalGateway, StripeGateway, and SqlOrderRepository.) Tj
T* (4. Inject IPaymentGateway and IOrderRepository into OrderProcessor constructor via Dependency Injection. OrderProcessor) Tj
T* (now adheres to all SOLID principles.) Tj
